# Three Steps Ahead makes an Officer token copy of Academy Instructor. The copy is itself an Officer token and counts itself (CR 109.2, 611.3a, 707.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Academy Instructor
Black Lotus
Three Steps Ahead
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Academy Instructor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Three Steps Ahead.Cast
Bot1.Modes(2)
Bot1.Target(Academy Instructor)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Academy Instructor#1.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Academy Instructor#2.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Academy Instructor#2.Token = true
